# CUTLASS CUP: hold B with a full bar to charge; release to swing a Super
# Shot, which costs one bar. Hamdi's is the Comet.
game cutlass
wait 5
cheat match 0 1
cheat cpu 1 0
wait 2
cheat play
cheat pos 0 60 100
cheat meter 0 2
hold B
wait 34
expect st0 == 6
cheat ball 70 100 0 0
release B
wait 8
expect ball_kind == 1
expect ball_team == 0
expect meter0 == 0
